{"real": false, "dur": 86.6, "sent": [{"start": 0.4, "end": 5.02, "text": "Each unit combines linguistic goals and communicative goals, which L’Atelier calls situations.", "words": [{"w": "Each", "s": 0.4}, {"w": "unit", "s": 0.78}, {"w": "combines", "s": 1.17}, {"w": "linguistic", "s": 1.55}, {"w": "goals", "s": 1.94}, {"w": "and", "s": 2.32}, {"w": "communicative", "s": 2.71}, {"w": "goals,", "s": 3.09}, {"w": "which", "s": 3.48}, {"w": "L’Atelier", "s": 3.86}, {"w": "calls", "s": 4.25}, {"w": "situations.", "s": 4.63}]}, {"start": 5.37, "end": 12.29, "text": "Each linguistic goal gets a lesson page, while each situation represents something learners can do with the language.", "words": [{"w": "Each", "s": 5.37}, {"w": "linguistic", "s": 5.75}, {"w": "goal", "s": 6.13}, {"w": "gets", "s": 6.52}, {"w": "a", "s": 6.9}, {"w": "lesson", "s": 7.29}, {"w": "page,", "s": 7.67}, {"w": "while", "s": 8.06}, {"w": "each", "s": 8.44}, {"w": "situation", "s": 8.83}, {"w": "represents", "s": 9.21}, {"w": "something", "s": 9.6}, {"w": "learners", "s": 9.98}, {"w": "can", "s": 10.37}, {"w": "do", "s": 10.75}, {"w": "with", "s": 11.13}, {"w": "the", "s": 11.52}, {"w": "language.", "s": 11.9}]}, {"start": 12.64, "end": 16.1, "text": "Sometimes the book packs several things into one situation.", "words": [{"w": "Sometimes", "s": 12.64}, {"w": "the", "s": 13.02}, {"w": "book", "s": 13.41}, {"w": "packs", "s": 13.79}, {"w": "several", "s": 14.18}, {"w": "things", "s": 14.56}, {"w": "into", "s": 14.95}, {"w": "one", "s": 15.33}, {"w": "situation.", "s": 15.72}]}, {"start": 16.45, "end": 21.45, "text": "When it does, I split them up, so each situation has one purpose.", "words": [{"w": "When", "s": 16.45}, {"w": "it", "s": 16.83}, {"w": "does,", "s": 17.22}, {"w": "I", "s": 17.6}, {"w": "split", "s": 17.99}, {"w": "them", "s": 18.37}, {"w": "up,", "s": 18.76}, {"w": "so", "s": 19.14}, {"w": "each", "s": 19.53}, {"w": "situation", "s": 19.91}, {"w": "has", "s": 20.3}, {"w": "one", "s": 20.68}, {"w": "purpose.", "s": 21.07}]}, {"start": 21.8, "end": 24.49, "text": "The two kinds meet in a grid.", "words": [{"w": "The", "s": 21.8}, {"w": "two", "s": 22.18}, {"w": "kinds", "s": 22.57}, {"w": "meet", "s": 22.95}, {"w": "in", "s": 23.34}, {"w": "a", "s": 23.72}, {"w": "grid.", "s": 24.11}]}, {"start": 24.84, "end": 29.07, "text": "Linguistic goals go down the side, situations go across the top.", "words": [{"w": "Linguistic", "s": 24.84}, {"w": "goals", "s": 25.23}, {"w": "go", "s": 25.61}, {"w": "down", "s": 26.0}, {"w": "the", "s": 26.38}, {"w": "side,", "s": 26.77}, {"w": "situations", "s": 27.15}, {"w": "go", "s": 27.53}, {"w": "across", "s": 27.92}, {"w": "the", "s": 28.3}, {"w": "top.", "s": 28.69}]}, {"start": 29.42, "end": 31.35, "text": "Here’s part of Unit 2.", "words": [{"w": "Here’s", "s": 29.42}, {"w": "part", "s": 29.81}, {"w": "of", "s": 30.19}, {"w": "Unit", "s": 30.58}, {"w": "2.", "s": 30.96}]}, {"start": 31.7, "end": 36.7, "text": "“To like the” helps you say what you like, and also say why.", "words": [{"w": "“To", "s": 31.7}, {"w": "like", "s": 32.08}, {"w": "the”", "s": 32.47}, {"w": "helps", "s": 32.85}, {"w": "you", "s": 33.23}, {"w": "say", "s": 33.62}, {"w": "what", "s": 34.0}, {"w": "you", "s": 34.39}, {"w": "like,", "s": 34.77}, {"w": "and", "s": 35.16}, {"w": "also", "s": 35.54}, {"w": "say", "s": 35.93}, {"w": "why.", "s": 36.31}]}, {"start": 37.05, "end": 40.12, "text": "Negation turns up in several situations at once.", "words": [{"w": "Negation", "s": 37.05}, {"w": "turns", "s": 37.43}, {"w": "up", "s": 37.82}, {"w": "in", "s": 38.2}, {"w": "several", "s": 38.58}, {"w": "situations", "s": 38.97}, {"w": "at", "s": 39.35}, {"w": "once.", "s": 39.74}]}, {"start": 40.47, "end": 47.01, "text": "One linguistic goal can serve lots of situations, and one situation can need lots of linguistic goals.", "words": [{"w": "One", "s": 40.47}, {"w": "linguistic", "s": 40.86}, {"w": "goal", "s": 41.24}, {"w": "can", "s": 41.63}, {"w": "serve", "s": 42.01}, {"w": "lots", "s": 42.4}, {"w": "of", "s": 42.78}, {"w": "situations,", "s": 43.17}, {"w": "and", "s": 43.55}, {"w": "one", "s": 43.93}, {"w": "situation", "s": 44.32}, {"w": "can", "s": 44.7}, {"w": "need", "s": 45.09}, {"w": "lots", "s": 45.47}, {"w": "of", "s": 45.86}, {"w": "linguistic", "s": 46.24}, {"w": "goals.", "s": 46.63}]}, {"start": 47.36, "end": 54.28, "text": "So with the grid, I can see at a glance what a learner needs before tackling each situation.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 47.36}, {"w": "with", "s": 47.75}, {"w": "the", "s": 48.13}, {"w": "grid,", "s": 48.52}, {"w": "I", "s": 48.9}, {"w": "can", "s": 49.28}, {"w": "see", "s": 49.67}, {"w": "at", "s": 50.05}, {"w": "a", "s": 50.44}, {"w": "glance", "s": 50.82}, {"w": "what", "s": 51.21}, {"w": "a", "s": 51.59}, {"w": "learner", "s": 51.98}, {"w": "needs", "s": 52.36}, {"w": "before", "s": 52.75}, {"w": "tackling", "s": 53.13}, {"w": "each", "s": 53.52}, {"w": "situation.", "s": 53.9}]}, {"start": 54.63, "end": 67.33, "text": "This actually brings together two approaches Wilkins talked about: building language up piece by piece, which is the synthetic approach, and starting with what learners need to do, which is the analytic approach.", "words": [{"w": "This", "s": 54.63}, {"w": "actually", "s": 55.02}, {"w": "brings", "s": 55.4}, {"w": "together", "s": 55.79}, {"w": "two", "s": 56.17}, {"w": "approaches", "s": 56.56}, {"w": "Wilkins", "s": 56.94}, {"w": "talked", "s": 57.33}, {"w": "about:", "s": 57.71}, {"w": "building", "s": 58.1}, {"w": "language", "s": 58.48}, {"w": "up", "s": 58.87}, {"w": "piece", "s": 59.25}, {"w": "by", "s": 59.63}, {"w": "piece,", "s": 60.02}, {"w": "which", "s": 60.4}, {"w": "is", "s": 60.79}, {"w": "the", "s": 61.17}, {"w": "synthetic", "s": 61.56}, {"w": "approach,", "s": 61.94}, {"w": "and", "s": 62.33}, {"w": "starting", "s": 62.71}, {"w": "with", "s": 63.1}, {"w": "what", "s": 63.48}, {"w": "learners", "s": 63.87}, {"w": "need", "s": 64.25}, {"w": "to", "s": 64.63}, {"w": "do,", "s": 65.02}, {"w": "which", "s": 65.4}, {"w": "is", "s": 65.79}, {"w": "the", "s": 66.17}, {"w": "analytic", "s": 66.56}, {"w": "approach.", "s": 66.94}]}, {"start": 67.68, "end": 72.68, "text": "Janice Yalden called something similar a proportional syllabus, bringing structure and communication together.", "words": [{"w": "Janice", "s": 67.68}, {"w": "Yalden", "s": 68.06}, {"w": "called", "s": 68.45}, {"w": "something", "s": 68.83}, {"w": "similar", "s": 69.22}, {"w": "a", "s": 69.6}, {"w": "proportional", "s": 69.98}, {"w": "syllabus,", "s": 70.37}, {"w": "bringing", "s": 70.75}, {"w": "structure", "s": 71.14}, {"w": "and", "s": 71.52}, {"w": "communication", "s": 71.91}, {"w": "together.", "s": 72.29}]}, {"start": 73.03, "end": 77.26, "text": "Every unit finishes with one task that uses all its situations.", "words": [{"w": "Every", "s": 73.03}, {"w": "unit", "s": 73.41}, {"w": "finishes", "s": 73.8}, {"w": "with", "s": 74.18}, {"w": "one", "s": 74.57}, {"w": "task", "s": 74.95}, {"w": "that", "s": 75.33}, {"w": "uses", "s": 75.72}, {"w": "all", "s": 76.1}, {"w": "its", "s": 76.49}, {"w": "situations.", "s": 76.87}]}, {"start": 77.61, "end": 79.53, "text": "L’Atelier calls it the Mission.", "words": [{"w": "L’Atelier", "s": 77.61}, {"w": "calls", "s": 77.99}, {"w": "it", "s": 78.38}, {"w": "the", "s": 78.76}, {"w": "Mission.", "s": 79.15}]}, {"start": 79.88, "end": 85.65, "text": "In the new plan, the French course has thirty-seven situations and around sixty linguistic goals.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 79.88}, {"w": "the", "s": 80.27}, {"w": "new", "s": 80.65}, {"w": "plan,", "s": 81.03}, {"w": "the", "s": 81.42}, {"w": "French", "s": 81.8}, {"w": "course", "s": 82.19}, {"w": "has", "s": 82.57}, {"w": "thirty-seven", "s": 82.96}, {"w": "situations", "s": 83.34}, {"w": "and", "s": 83.73}, {"w": "around", "s": 84.11}, {"w": "sixty", "s": 84.5}, {"w": "linguistic", "s": 84.88}, {"w": "goals.", "s": 85.27}]}]}